    {"id": "welcome", "shotId": "classroom-wide", "startSeconds": 0, "durationSeconds": 8, "narration": "今天，教室裡藏著一個小宇宙！你找到桌上的太陽系了嗎？", "interaction": "tap-model"},
    {"id": "approach", "shotId": "approach-solar", "startSeconds": 8, "durationSeconds": 10, "narration": "靠近看看！太陽在中間，八顆行星沿著各自的軌道繞著它轉。", "teachingNote": "說明大小與距離經過調整，畫面不是實際比例。"},
    {"id": "our-home", "shotId": "earth-close", "startSeconds": 18, "durationSeconds": 12, "narration": "找到藍色的地球了！這是我們的家。用手轉一轉，換個方向看。", "interaction": "rotate-view", "videoDemonstration": "slow-orbit-camera"},
    {"id": "compare", "shotId": "earth-jupiter-size", "startSeconds": 30, "durationSeconds": 14, "narration": "地球和木星，哪一顆比較大？先猜猜，再看看它們並排的樣子。", "teachingNote": "使用共用的直徑比例；不把距離也假裝成相同比例。"},
